\tag{fdip}
\title{Several orbits, a neutral bit and unitary gauge}
\date{2026-11-21}

\p{A scalar may take values in more than one group orbit, and an extra
bit at each vertex may weight one orbit differently from another.
After the frames are fixed, which data determine a gauge orbit, and
how many scalar values does that orbit contain?}

